# Success on Algorithmic and LOCS vs. Conceptual Chemistry Exam Questions.

**Authors:** Zoller, Uri, And Others

## Abstract
Analyzes differences in students' performance on algorithmic, lower-order cognitive skills (LOCS), and conceptual exam questions and the correlations between their achievements on these categories across different populations.Reports that the highest scores were obtained for the algorithmic questions, the lowest for the conceptual questions, and scores for the LOCS fell between the two extremes. (JRH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ520568

